","phonetic":"/prəˈvaɪd/","meaning":"提供"},{"word":"pull","phonetic":"/pʊl/","meaning":"拉"},{"word":"push","phonetic":"/pʊʃ/","meaning":"推"},{"word":"quick","phonetic":"/kwɪk/","meaning":"快的"},{"word":"quiet","phonetic":"/ˈkwaɪət/","meaning":"安静的"},{"word":"quite","phonetic":"/kwaɪt/","meaning":"相当"}],"sentences":[{"en":"I'm able to finish the work by myself.","zh":"我能独立完成这项工作。"},{"en":"She has the ability to speak three languages.","zh":"她有能力说三种语言。"},{"en":"We are talking about our plans for the weekend.","zh":"我们正在谈论周末的计划。"},{"en":"The sun rises above the mountains.","zh":"太阳从群山上方升起。"},{"en":"He accepted my invitation with a smile.","zh":"他微笑着接受了我的邀请。"},{"en":"You can achieve your dream if you work hard.","zh":"如果你努力，就能实现梦想。"},{"en":"The bridge goes across the river.","zh":"这座桥横跨河流。"},{"en":"We had an interesting activity at school today.","zh":"今天我们在学校进行了一项有趣的活动。"},{"en":"Please add some milk to the coffee.","zh":"请往咖啡里加一些牛奶。"},{"en":"Could you tell me your address?","zh":"你能告诉我你的地址吗？"},{"en":"My teacher gave me some useful advice.","zh":"老师给了我一些有用的建议。"},{"en":"I can't afford such an expensive phone.","zh":"我买不起这么贵的手机。"},{"en":"He was afraid to speak in public.","zh":"他害怕在公共场合说话。"},{"en":"Let's meet again next week.","zh":"我们下周再见面吧。"},{"en":"They are against the plan to build a factory here.","zh":"他们反对在这里建工厂的计划。"},{"en":"We met each other two years ago.","zh":"我们两年前见过面。"},{"en":"I agree with your idea completely.","zh":"我完全同意你的想法。"},{"en":"The air in the countryside is very fresh.","zh":"乡下的空气非常清新。"},{"en":"We took a plane at the airport this morning.","zh":"今天早上我们在机场乘了飞机。"},{"en":"My parents don't allow me to stay up late.","zh":"我父母不允许我熬夜。"},{"en":"Almost all the students passed the exam.","zh":"几乎所有学生都通过了考试。"},{"en":"He prefers to study alone in his room.","zh":"他更喜欢独自在房间里学习。"},{"en":"We walked along the river after dinner.","zh":"晚饭后我们沿着河边散步。"},{"en":"I have already finished my homework.","zh":"我已经完成了作业。"},{"en":"Although it rained, we still went hiking.","zh":"虽然下雨了，我们还是去远足了。"},{"en":"She is always ready to help others.","zh":"她总是乐于帮助别人。"},{"en":"We visited an ancient temple last weekend.","zh":"上周末我们参观了一座古庙。"},{"en":"Don't be angry with me, please.","zh":"请不要生我的气。"},{"en":"Would you like another cup of tea?","zh":"你想再要一杯茶吗？"},{"en":"I'm anxious about the coming exam.","zh":"我对即将到来的考试感到焦虑。"},{"en":"You can find me anywhere in the city.","zh":"你在这个城市任何地方都能找到我。"},{"en":"Stars appear in the sky at night.","zh":"夜晚星星出现在天空。"},{"en":"They argued about who should clean the room.","zh":"他们争论谁该打扫房间。"},{"en":"We arrived at the station on time.","zh":"我们准时到达了车站。"},{"en":"Please pay attention to the teacher in class.","zh":"上课时请专心听老师讲。"},{"en":"You should avoid making the same mistake.","zh":"你应该避免犯同样的错误。"},{"en":"The baby is awake now.","zh":"婴儿现在醒了。"},{"en":"The weather was awful yesterday.","zh":"昨天天气很糟糕。"},{"en":"He did badly in the test this time.","zh":"他这次考试考得很差。"},{"en":"We beat them in the football match.","zh":"我们在足球比赛中打败了他们。"},{"en":"She has become a better person over the years.","zh":"这些年来她变成了更好的人。"},{"en":"I believe you can do it well.","zh":"我相信你能做好。"},{"en":"This book belongs to my sister.","zh":"这本书属于我姐姐。"},{"en":"The dog is sleeping beside the fire.","zh":"狗正在火炉旁睡觉。"},{"en":"The bank is between the school and the hospital.","zh":"银行在学校和医院之间。"},{"en":"Don't blame others for your own mistakes.","zh":"不要因为自己的错误而责怪别人。"},{"en":"He is blind in one eye.","zh":"他一只眼睛失明。"},{"en":"You can borrow the book from the library.","zh":"你可以从图书馆借这本书。"},{"en":"Both my parents are teachers.","zh":"我父母都是老师。"},{"en":"Please bring your homework to class tomorrow.","zh":"明天请把作业带到课堂上来。"},{"en":"The building was built last year.","zh":"这栋楼是去年建的。"},{"en":"My father runs a small business in town.","zh":"我父亲在镇上经营一家小生意。"},{"en":"He is busy with his work these days.","zh":"这些天他忙于工作。"},{"en":"Please call me when you get home.","zh":"到家后请给我打电话。"},{"en":"Keep calm and don't worry.","zh":"保持冷静，别担心。"},{"en":"We decided to cancel the trip because of the rain.","zh":"因为下雨，我们决定取消这次旅行。"},{"en":"Beijing is the capital of China.","zh":"北京是中国的首都。"},{"en":"You should be careful when you cross the road.","zh":"过马路时你应该小心。"},{"en":"Please carry this box to the classroom.","zh":"请把这个箱子搬到教室。"},{"en":"He caught the last train to Beijing.","zh":"他赶上了去北京的最后一班火车。"},{"en":"We celebrate the Spring Festival every year.","zh":"我们每年都庆祝春节。"},{"en":"We have lived here for a century.","zh":"我们在这里住了一个世纪。"},{"en":"This is a good chance to improve my English.","zh":"这是提高我英语的好机会。"},{"en":"Please check your answers before you hand in.","zh":"交卷前请检查你的答案。"},{"en":"She chose the blue dress in the end.","zh":"她最后选择了那条蓝色连衣裙。"},{"en":"The students are cleaning the classroom.","zh":"学生们正在打扫教室。"},{"en":"The weather is clear and sunny today.","zh":"今天天气晴朗。"},{"en":"She collected many beautiful stamps.","zh":"她收集了许多漂亮的邮票。"},{"en":"He goes to college in another city.","zh":"他在另一个城市上大学。"},{"en":"This sofa is very comfortable to sit on.","zh":"这张沙发坐起来非常舒适。"},{"en":"It's common for students to make mistakes.","zh":"学生犯错误是很常见的。"},{"en":"We should communicate with our parents often.","zh":"我们应该经常和父母交流。"},{"en":"Compare the two pictures and find the differences.","zh":"比较这两幅图，找出不同之处。"},{"en":"You must concentrate on your study.","zh":"你必须专心学习。"},{"en":"Be confident and you will succeed.","zh":"要自信，你就会成功。"},{"en":"We congratulated her on winning the prize.","zh":"我们祝贺她获奖。"},{"en":"Please consider my suggestion carefully.","zh":"请仔细考虑我的建议。"},{"en":"We continued to walk even though it was dark.","zh":"尽管天黑了，我们还是继续走。"},{"en":"It's convenient to take the subway in this city.","zh":"在这个城市坐地铁很方便。"},{"en":"Please copy these words into your notebook.","zh":"请把这些单词抄到笔记本上。"},{"en":"The price of the computer costs a lot.","zh":"这台电脑的价格很贵。"},{"en":"It takes courage to tell the truth.","zh":"说出真相需要勇气。"},{"en":"Of course I will help you.","zh":"我当然会帮你。"},{"en":"Please cover the food with a plate.","zh":"请用盘子把食物盖住。"},{"en":"The artist created many wonderful paintings.","zh":"这位艺术家创作了许多精彩画作。"},{"en":"We must cross the street at the zebra crossing.","zh":"我们必须走斑马线过马路。"},{"en":"The crowd cheered for the players.","zh":"人群为运动员欢呼。"},{"en":"Learning a foreign culture is interesting.","zh":"学习外国文化很有趣。"},{"en":"The customer wants to buy a new coat.","zh":"这位顾客想买一件新外套。"},{"en":"Reading is my daily habit.","zh":"阅读是我的日常习惯。"},{"en":"What happened to you this morning?","zh":"今天早上你发生了什么事？"},{"en":"Too much junk food can harm your health.","zh":"太多的垃圾食品会损害你的健康。"},{"en":"The farmers are busy with the harvest.","zh":"农民们正忙着收获。"},{"en":"Exercise is good for your health.","zh":"锻炼对你的健康有好处。"},{"en":"She hid behind the door to surprise me.","zh":"她藏在门后想给我惊喜。"},{"en":"We will hold a party for his birthday.","zh":"我们将为他的生日举办聚会。"},{"en":"You should be honest with your friends.","zh":"你应该对朋友诚实。"},{"en":"The hospital is far from here.","zh":"医院离这里很远。"},{"en":"However, he didn't give up.","zh":"然而，他没有放弃。"},{"en":"The hungry boy ate the whole cake.","zh":"饥饿的男孩吃完了整个蛋糕。"}],"grammar":[{"category":"be动词","question":"There ___ a book on the desk.","options":["is","are","am","be"],"answer":0,"explain":"there be 句型，单数主语用 is。","question_zh":"书桌上有一本书。"},{"category":"be动词","question":"Neither of them ___ right.","options":["is","are","am","were"],"answer":0,"explain":"neither of + 复数名词，谓语用单数。","question_zh":"他们俩都不对。"},{"category":"时态-一般现在","question":"He ___ to school every day.","options":["go","goes","going","went"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语 he 三单，一般现在时动词加 es。","question_zh":"他每天去上学。"},{"category":"时态-一般现在","question":"The earth ___ around the sun.","options":["move","moves","moving","moved"],"answer":1,"explain":"客观真理用一般现在时，主语 the earth 三单加 s。","question_zh":"地球绕着太阳转。"},{"category":"时态-一般过去","question":"I ___ my homework last night.","options":["do","does","did","doing"],"answer":2,"explain":"last night 是过去时间，用过去式 did。","question_zh":"我昨晚做了作业。"},{"category":"时态-一般过去","question":"She ___ to the library yesterday.","options":["go","goes","went","gone"],"answer":2,"explain":"yesterday 过去时间，用 went。","question_zh":"她昨天去了图书馆。"},{"category":"时态-现在进行","question":"Listen! The baby ___ crying.","options":["cry","cries","is crying","cried"],"answer":2,"explain":"Listen! 提示动作正在进行，用现在进行时。","question_zh":"听！婴儿正在哭。"},{"category":"时态-现在完成","question":"I ___ already finished my homework.","options":["have","has","had","am"],"answer":0,"explain":"主语 I 用 have + 过去分词。","question_zh":"我已经完成作业了。"},{"category":"时态-现在完成","question":"She has ___ here for five years.","options":["live","lived","lives","living"],"answer":1,"explain":"现在完成时用 have/has + 过去分词。","question_zh":"她在这里住了五年。"},{"category":"时态-将来","question":"We ___ visit the museum tomorrow.","options":["are going to","will","are going","going to"],"answer":1,"explain":"tomorrow 表将来，用 will + 动词原形。","question_zh":"我们明天将参观博物馆。"},{"category":"时态-将来","question":"It ___ rain this afternoon.","options":["is going to","is going","will going","going"],"answer":0,"explain":"be going to + 动词原形表将来。","question_zh":"今天下午将要下雨。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"You ___ return the book on time.","options":["must","mustn't","need","dare"],"answer":0,"explain":"must 表示必须。","question_zh":"你必须按时还书。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"He ___ speak English very well.","options":["can","may","must","should"],"answer":0,"explain":"can 表示能力。","question_zh":"他英语说得很好。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"You ___ smoke here. It's not allowed.","options":["mustn't","needn't","can't","don't"],"answer":0,"explain":"mustn't 表示禁止。","question_zh":"你不能在这里抽烟。这是不允许的。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"___ I use your pen? Yes, you may.","options":["Must","May","Need","Shall"],"answer":1,"explain":"may 表示请求许可。","question_zh":"我可以用你的钢笔吗？可以。"},{"category":"被动语态","question":"The book ___ by many students.","options":["is read","reads","is reading","read"],"answer":0,"explain":"一般现在时被动语态：be + 过去分词。","question_zh":"这本书被许多学生阅读。"},{"category":"被动语态","question":"The bridge ___ last year.","options":["was built","is built","built","has built"],"answer":0,"explain":"last year 过去时间被动：was + 过去分词。","question_zh":"这座桥是去年建的。"},{"category":"比较级","question":"This box is ___ than that one.","options":["heavy","heavier","heaviest","heavily"],"answer":1,"explain":"比较级用 -er，heavy 变 y 为 i 加 er。","question_zh":"这个箱子比那个重。"},{"category":"比较级","question":"Which is ___, the sun or the moon?","options":["big","bigger","biggest","more big"],"answer":1,"explain":"两者比较用比较级 bigger。","question_zh":"太阳和月亮哪个更大？"},{"category":"最高级","question":"This is the ___ book in the library.","options":["good","better","best","well"],"answer":2,"explain":"三者以上比较用最高级 the best。","question_zh":"这是图书馆里最好的书。"},{"category":"最高级","question":"He is the ___ student in our class.","options":["tall","taller","tallest","more tall"],"answer":2,"explain":"全班范围比较用最高级 tallest。","question_zh":"他是我们班最高的学生。"},{"category":"代词","question":"This book is ___. It's mine.","options":["my","me","mine","myself"],"answer":2,"explain":"名词性物主代词 mine 作表语。","question_zh":"这本书是我的。"},{"category":"代词","question":"Help ___ to some fish, please.","options":["you","yourself","yours","your"],"answer":1,"explain":"反身代词 yourself 表“随意取用”。","question_zh":"请随便吃点鱼吧。"},{"category":"代词","question":"The children enjoyed ___ at the party.","options":["they","them","themselves","their"],"answer":2,"explain":"enjoy oneself 固定搭配，用反身代词。","question_zh":"孩子们在聚会上玩得很开心。"},{"category":"冠词","question":"___ sun rises in the east.","options":["A","An","The","/"],"answer":2,"explain":"世界上独一无二的事物前用 the。","question_zh":"太阳从东方升起。"},{"category":"冠词","question":"He is ___ honest man.","options":["a","an","the","/"],"answer":1,"explain":"honest 以元音音素开头，用 an。","question_zh":"他是一个诚实的人。"},{"category":"介词","question":"She has lived here ___ 2019.","options":["for","since","in","at"],"answer":1,"explain":"since + 时间点；for + 时间段。","question_zh":"她从2019年起就住在这里。"},{"category":"介词","question":"He is good ___ playing basketball.","options":["in","at","on","for"],"answer":1,"explain":"be good at 擅长。","question_zh":"他擅长打篮球。"},{"category":"介词","question":"The teacher is talking ___ the students.","options":["to","at","for","about"],"answer":0,"explain":"talk to sb. 和某人交谈。","question_zh":"老师正在和学生交谈。"},{"category":"条件句","question":"If it ___ tomorrow, we will stay at home.","options":["rain","rains","rained","will rain"],"answer":1,"explain":"主将从现：if 从句用一般现在时。","question_zh":"如果明天下雨，我们就待在家。"},{"category":"条件句","question":"If I ___ time, I will come to see you.","options":["have","has","will have","had"],"answer":0,"explain":"主将从现：if 从句用一般现在时。","question_zh":"如果我有时间，我会来看你。"},{"category":"疑问句","question":"___ you like coffee or tea?","options":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"answer":0,"explain":"主语 you 用助动词 Do。","question_zh":"你喜欢咖啡还是茶？"},{"category":"疑问句","question":"___ he play the piano? Yes, he does.","options":["Do","Does","Is","Did"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语 he 三单用 Does。","question_zh":"他会弹钢琴吗？是的。"},{"category":"疑问句-反义","question":"She can swim, ___ she?","options":["can","can't","does","is"],"answer":1,"explain":"反义疑问句：前肯后否，用 can't。","question_zh":"她会游泳，不是吗？"},{"category":"疑问句-反义","question":"It isn't cold today, ___ it?","options":["is","isn't","does","doesn't"],"answer":0,"explain":"前否后肯，用 is。","question_zh":"今天不冷，不是吗？"},{"category":"不定式","question":"I want ___ to the park.","options":["go","to go","going","went"],"answer":1,"explain":"want to do sth. 想做某事。","question_zh":"我想去公园。"},{"category":"动名词","question":"I enjoy ___ English songs.","options":["listen","to listen","listening","listened"],"answer":2,"explain":"enjoy doing sth. 喜欢做某事。","question_zh":"我喜欢听英语歌曲。"},{"category":"动名词","question":"He is good at ___ kites.","options":["make","to make","making","made"],"answer":2,"explain":"be good at + doing。","question_zh":"他擅长做风筝。"},{"category":"宾语从句","question":"I don't know ___ he will come.","options":["if","that","what","which"],"answer":0,"explain":"whether/if 引导宾语从句表“是否”。","question_zh":"我不知道他是否会来。"}]}
